      "label": "继续深入山林，寻找更多灵石",
      "intent": "explore",
      "targetId": "stones",
      "stake": "high",
      "approach": "cautious"
    },
    {
      "id": "r:17d4b63b7a333a81:t2:c:c",
      "label": "尝试与野猪沟通，了解山中情况",
      "intent": "negotiate",
